    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Lena Sculptural Flower Candle | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Lena sculptural flower candle by Serentique, selected by KASODI for its softly curved botanical form, cream finish and decorative presence."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/candles-fragrance">Candles & Fragrance</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Lena Sculptural Flower Candle</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/candles-fragrance/serentique-lena-sculptural-flower-candle.png"
            alt="Lena sculptural flower candle by Serentique styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · CANDLES & FRAGRANCE
          </p>

          <h1>
            Lena Sculptural Flower Candle
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Serentique
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A decorative candle shaped like a softly opening flower, with curved,
            finely ribbed petals and a warm cream finish. Made from plant-based
            natural wax, Lena works as much like a small sculptural object as a
            candle, bringing texture and quiet character to a shelf, console or
            coffee table.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Plant-based natural wax</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Size</span>
              <strong>10 × 10 × 7 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Weight</span>
              <strong>Approx. 370 g</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Soft cream</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Burn time</span>
              <strong>Up to 20 hours</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Style</span>
              <strong>Sculptural · Botanical</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/46XYpCD"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Lena sits somewhere between a candle and a small decorative object.
            Its overlapping, ribbed petals create a sculptural silhouette that
            feels organic rather than overly polished, while the creamy neutral
            tone keeps the design calm and easy to place.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like it styled on stone, wood or a simple tray alongside
            ceramics and natural textures. Even unlit, the shape adds softness and
            dimension; once lit, the curved surface catches the warm candlelight
            and makes the form even more expressive.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Keep the sculptural shape beautiful</h2>

        <p>
          Place the candle on a stable, heat-resistant surface away from drafts
          and flammable objects. Trim the wick before lighting and never leave a
          burning candle unattended. Because of its sculptural form, we recommend
          using a candle plate or decorative tray to protect the surface beneath
          it as the wax softens.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Travertine & Stone</h3>
            <p>
              Warm stone surfaces echo the candle's natural cream palette and
              give its sculptural silhouette a quiet architectural backdrop.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Textured Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Pair it with handmade or softly textured ceramics in ivory, sand
              and earthy neutral tones for a collected, tactile arrangement.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Warm Brass</h3>
            <p>
              A small brass tray, bowl or decorative detail introduces a subtle
              glow and gives the soft cream wax a more elevated finish.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>CANDLES & FRAGRANCE</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/candles-fragrance/sculptural-ivory-candles"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-sculptural-ivory-candles.png"
                alt="Sculptural Ivory Candles"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>CANDLES</span>
              <h3>Sculptural Ivory Candles</h3>
              <p>ALMA DE LLAMA</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/home-decor/blue-floral-ceramic-pitcher"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-decor/blue-floral-ceramic-pitcher.png"
                alt="Blue Floral Ceramic Pitcher"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME DECOR</span>
              <h3>Blue Floral Ceramic Pitcher</h3>
              <p>Curated by KASODI</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/textiles-cozy/cream-tassel-table-runner"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/textiles-cozy/cream-tassel-table-runner.png"
                alt="Cream Tassel Table Runner"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TEXTILES & COZY</span>
              <h3>Cream Tassel Table Runner</h3>
              <p>Curated by KASODI</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          SERENTIQUE · SCULPTURAL CANDLE
        </p>

        <h2>
          A small sculptural detail for a softer room.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/46XYpCD"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>